  "project_description": "This module provide an adapter between Media Contextual Crop API and Image Widget Crop Plugin \n\n This module is just a plugin use by Media Contextual Crop implementation please check :\n\n - Media Contextual Cropping Embed \n\n- Media Contextual Cropping Field Formatter \n\n Requirements \n - Media Contextual Crop API \n\n- Image Widget Crop Plugin \n\n Branchs \n 1.1.x \n The 1.1.x branch are compatible with 1.2.x branch of main module in order to make it compatible with the core responsive_image formatter\n\n 2.0.x \n - Fully compatible with Media_contextual_crop 2.0.x release\n\n- Add context in embed media, in order to limit ghost crop & images\n\n- Remove all Drupal 9 compatibilities\n\n Back to top",
